            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>total</code> değişkenini oluştur ve <code>savings</code> dizisindeki öğelerin toplamını bu değişkende sakla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"savings = [\" /><text value=\"220\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"70\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"total = sum(savings)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(total)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"50\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1340\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>total = sum(savings)</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
