            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Listeleri arka arkaya birleştirerek daha büyük tek bir liste oluşturmak için hangi kodu kullanırız?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>+</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>sum()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Böyle bir kod yok</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>count()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>+</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Plus operator",
            "id": 82964,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Üç aylık tasarruflardan oluşan iki listeyi birleştir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"savings_1 = [\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"70\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"savings_2 = [\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(savings_1 + savings_2)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"87\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[100, 20, 70, 50, 0, 200, 10, 40]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>savings_1 + savings_2</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Appended at the end",
            "id": 82965,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>İlk ve ikinci görüntüleme ifadesi arasındaki fark nedir?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"prefix = [\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"number = [\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"7\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(prefix + number)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(number + prefix)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[0, 0, 4, 5, 5, 5, 3, 7, 0, 1]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"[5, 5, 3, 7, 0, 1, 0, 0, 4, 5]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">İlkinde <code>prefix</code> listesi önce görüntülenir</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">İlkinde, <code>number</code> listesi önce görüntülenir</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Görüntüleme ifadeleri arasında fark yoktur</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Sayılar ikincisinde rastgele karıştırılır</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">İlkinde <code>prefix</code> listesi önce görüntülenir.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
