            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu, konsolda ne görüntüler?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"student_1 = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Anna&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"student_2 = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Joe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"group = student_1 + student_2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(group)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"['Anna', 16, 'Joe', 17]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>['Anna', 16, 'Joe', 17]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>['Anna', 'Joe', 16, 17]</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Hiçbir şey, karışık türler içeren listeleri birleştiremeyiz</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>['Joe', 17, 'Anna', 16]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>['Anna', 16, 'Joe', 17]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Different types",
            "id": 82968,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>String değerleri önce gelecek şekilde <code>movies</code> listesini <code>tickets_sold</code> listesine birleştir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"movies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Casablanca&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;The Shining&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"tickets_sold = [\" /><text value=\"57\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"48\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(movies + tickets_sold)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"91\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['Casablanca', 'The Shining', 57, 48]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>movies + tickets_sold</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
